      "writtenOn": "2025-11-10T15:25:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this information important? Or could we remove it from this comment? I am concerned about the risk of forgetting to update this size information when upgrading to a new version. This is a maintenance hazard.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 144,
        "startChar": 9,
